            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukwezi kw’indwi gushitse, Abisirayeli bamaze gushika mu bisagara vyabo, abantu bakoranira hamwe i Yerusalemu nk’umuntu umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki na bagenziwe b’abaherezi na Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli n’abo bari bafatanije batangura kwubaka igicaniro c’Imana y’Abisirayeli kugira ngo bashobore gushikana ibimazi bituririrwa kuri co, nk’uko vyari vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vya Mose umuntu w’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho bari bafise ubwoba kubera gutinya amahanga yari abakikije, barubatse igicaniro kw’itanguriro ryaco baca bagitangirako ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro, babishikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", vyaba ivyo mu gitondo canke ivyo ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nk’uko vyari vyanditswe, bahimbaza umusi mukuru w’insago, batanga igitigiri c’ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro nk’uko vyasabwa ku musi ku musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y’ivyo, baca bashikana ibimazi vyo guturirwa bisanzwe bitangwa, ibimazi vyo mu mboneko z’ukwezi n’ibimazi vy’imisi mikuru y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yose yategetswe, hamwe n’ivyazanywe n’umuntu wese ashikaniye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " avyishakiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi batangura gushikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro, naho itanguriro ry’Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ritari bwashirweho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
