        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko baha amahera abubatsi n’ababaji, baha abantu b’i Sidoni n’i Tiro ivyokurya, ibinyobwa n’amavuta kugira ngo bazane ibiti vy’amasederi babikuye i Libani gushika i Yopa, babicishije mu kiyaga, nk’uko vyari vyaremewe n’umwami Kuro w’i Buperesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kwa kabiri kw’umwaka ugira kabiri kuva bashitse i Yerusalemu ahari Ingoro y’Imana, Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki na benewabo basigaye b’abaherezi n’Abalewi n’abari bagarutse i Yerusalemu bavuye mu kinyago, batangura igikorwa. Bashiraho Abalewi bamaze imyaka mirongo ibiri n’iyirenga ngo bakurikirane igikorwa co gusanura Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuwa n’abahungu biwe n’abo bavukana, Kadimiyeli n’abahungu biwe (bakomoka kuri Hodaviya), abahungu ba Henadadi n’abahungu babo n’abo bavukana, bose bakaba bari Abalewi, barifatanya kugira ngo bashobore gukurikirana abakozi bariko barakora ku Ngoro y’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
